                      <p>We update CX Technology very regularly. You can always check our <a href="/collection/"
                          aria-current="page" class="w--current">Collection page</a> to see everything we’ve added
                        recently. New components, resources, and improvements are rolled out consistently to keep things
                        fresh.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">Can I suggest a resource for CX Technology to create?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p>Absolutely. We love hearing ideas from our community! That’s why we highly recommend joining
                        our <a href="/product/community/">Slack Community</a>. It’s a global space for designers and
                        creative developers, with dedicated channels for feedback, discussions, and submitting new
                        resource ideas.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">Is there a free trial or demo version I can explore first?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p>Yes!</p>
                      <p>We have a free demo that currently includes 20 resources from the Vault. You can explore them
                        right away and get a feel for how CX Technology works. <a href="/try">Sign up here</a> to try it
                        out.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-collection-status="not-active" data-faq-collection="Account"
          class="cx-collection-grid faq__collection w-dyn-list">
          <div data-accordion-css-init="" data-accordion-close-siblings="true" role="list"
            class="cx-collection-grid faq__list w-dyn-items">
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">Can I still use the resources when I cancel my membership?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p>Yes. When you cancel, you keep access until the end of your current billing period. After that,
                        your access to the CX Vault and Dashboard ends.<br /></p>
                      <p>Resources that were legitimately implemented in personal or client projects during your active
                        membership may continue to be used in those projects. You may not download or store used and
                        unused Resources outside the CX Vault for future use, redistribution, or resale.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">Do you have a team, studio or agency plan?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p>We do indeed! Head to the <a href="/plans/">pricing page</a>, and use the toggle above the
                        pricing cards to switch to the team plan. </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">Is there a refund policy for purchases?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p>Refunds may be available under certain conditions. Because our product is digital and access is
                        provided immediately after purchase, refund eligibility is limited. If you’re unsatisfied or
                        experience an issue with your purchase, <a href="mailto:cx@gmail.com">please contact
                          us</a> within 7 days of your account creation date, and we’ll work with you to find a
                        resolution. Please note that this 7-day refund window applies only to the initial account
                        creation period and does not reset with renewals or subsequent billing periods.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">Can I change my plan later?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p>Yes, you can switch between quarterly and yearly billing options at any time through your
                        account settings in the dashboard.</p>
                      <p>If you want to switch to a team account, please <a href="mailto:cx@gmail.com">email
                          us </a>or reach out in Slack. </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">How can I contact support if I have an issue?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p><a href="mailto:cx@gmail.com">Email us </a>or reach out in Slack. We’re active and
                        try to help quickly, and the community is great for troubleshooting too. If you run into a bug,
                        there&#x27;s usually lots of people ready to help out.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-accordion-status="not-active" role="listitem" class="faq__item w-dyn-item">
              <div data-accordion-toggle="" class="faq__item-top">
                <h3 class="p-l u--fw-medium">Can I share my CX Technology account with my co-worker or friend?</h3>
                <div class="faq__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13"
                    fill="none" class="svg">
                    <path
                      d="M5.96149 12.0996V6.99217H0.839844V5.20705H5.96149V0.0996094H7.74294V5.20705H12.8398V6.99217H7.74294V12.0996H5.96149Z"
                      fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq__item-bottom">
                <div class="faq__item-bottom-wrap">
                  <div class="faq__item-bottom-content">
                    <div class="rich-text w-richtext">
                      <p>No, not unless you’re on a team account. Regular CX Technology accounts are single-user.</p>
                      <p>If we suspect account sharing or other misuse, we reserve the right to temporarily disable
                        access until the situation is cleared up.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
